            "sid": "NUM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maŵasa ga Agelesomu tigaŵeje gakunyakula ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguwo syakuciga ku Cipinda Ceswela Mnope, ni tenti pamo ni nguwo syakucinga syakwe, lipende lya mbusi lyakuwunicila penani pakwe, ni nguwo jakucinga pa mlango ŵa ku tenti ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanyakuleje soni nguwo syakucinjila ku luŵala, nguwo syakucinjila pa cipata ca luŵala lusyungulile Cipinda Ceswela Mnope ni malo gakupelecela mbopesi, ngonji ni yida yine yosope yakusosekwa. Jemanjajo akamule cenene masengo gawo gapegwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose ni Aloni tacilolecesya kuti liŵasa lya Geleshoni lipanganyisye masengo gosopega ni kuyitenda yosope yiŵapele Aloni ni ŵanace ŵawo kuti jemanjajo ayitende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gelega ni masengo ga liŵasa lya Geleshoni mu Tenti, tacigapanganya pakulongoledwa ni Itamala mwanace jwa Aloni jwakutaga mbopesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
